# ==============================================================================
# Setup Instructions for Reviewers/Developers:
# ==============================================================================
# 1. Copy this file to .env.local: cp .env.local.example .env.local
# 2. The Cesium token above is a FREE token you can use immediately
# 3. No other API keys needed! The app uses public data sources:
#    - NASA TEMPO Satellite Data
#    - OpenAQ Ground Sensors
#    - Weather.gov API
# 4. Run: npm install && npm run dev
# 5. Visit: http://localhost:3000
#
# ALL DATA IS REAL - No fake/dummy data used!